  "reference_result": "809 exact cases per fixed32/64 profile; all609 committed parent observations unchanged;62PHP fixture source hashes per profile. R10 adds200 cases:60proxy metadata,90receiver lifetime,20strict aliases,8wrapperhooks,10staticdiagnostics,10staticmagic,2ordinaryguard/dynamiccontrols. No unsafe diagnostic counted as pass.",
  "test_first": {
    "remote_findings": "Root reviewed independent test-writer adapters, corrected invalid shutdown(nil) fixture calls to empty global value. Before semantic fixes proxy test panicked with missing slot; lifetime test produced wrong errors/results; weak numeric aliases rejected. Actual red logs retained; first proxy panic aborts remaining subtests and is not described as full run.",
    "independent_review": "Full suite exposed existing hook-proxy-backing-receiver regression from premature initialized-proxy entry forwarding. Removed those entry predelegations after Astra corrected proposal; wrapper hooks execute first. Added8cold/warm hookcontrols. Native static controls confirmed two notices are required, but Go labels/initializedunset were wrong; added10redcontrols then fixed. Native10staticmagic+2guard/dynamic controls then exposed premature notices and warmwrappermagic omission; red logs precede operation-aware fix.",
    "optimization": "Comparison ownership cases and hook ownership/throwing-cleanup cases passed before refactoring; escaping fixed hold slices reproduced144B/1alloc comparison,80B/1alloc scalarhook,224B/2alloc objecthook onhost. These Go-private controls do not addPHP casecounts."
  },
  "architecture": {
    "backing": "Resolve wrapper access/hooks first. Only after objectForProperty/Read changes receiver, restart full target descriptor/access/hook resolution under existing forwarding guards. Reference address resolver returns slot+descriptor or raw method value; caller binds only after resolver stack restores all guards. No callback between returned address and binding.",
    "lazy": "After original receiver hold cleanup merges errors, detect originalo.freed onlyiferrnil. Return exactError Lazy object was released during initialization; preserve initializer/destructor/hoststop precedence and legal rc0 constructor temporaries.",
    "aliases": "Pass caller strictness into exactlythree final PHP property stores viaassignPHP: dynamic,writeObjectSlot(includingraw),writeStatic. Internalassign remainsstrict. Reflectionraw fixture usesweakcoercion regardlessstricthelperfile. Typed byref argument precheck unchanged.",
    "holds": "Comparison holds originalleft/right in individualstack values, capture/retainleftthenright, cleanupbothleftthenright. Hook retainsreceiverFIRST, capturesrawRHSafterreceiverretain including sameidentity, optionalRHSstackhold; protectresultbeforeRHS->receiver->resultcleanup; mergeeveryerror. No finalizer/unsafe/cgo/newrequeststate.",
    "static_diagnostics": "Shared helper labels actualreceiverclass. OptionalmagicOperation preserves oldprivate4arg callers; staticbranch checks associatedmagicmethodexistence, independentofguard. Initializedproxyunset trieswrappermagicforstatic-as-instance beforeforwarding. Accesserrorsandisset silent unchanged.",
    "costs": "Static branch adds a method-table lookup when operation supplied; ordinary instance branch returns before it. Full metadata must re-resolve when target changes. Getter label construction still costs8B/1alloc in measuredcell; no universalzeroallocation/performanceclaim. Noaddedtable/object/valuefields.",
    "alternatives": "Rejected earlytargetforwarding (breakswrapperhooks), same-key-onlyfix (missesaccess/hooks), bindingduringresolverrecursion (guardoutlivesdestinationdestructor), eagergenericholdNrefactor (operandsvariableN), extrapropertyresolutionresultstate (unneededforstaticnotice). Existingtyped slots andstableblocks remain unchanged."
  },
